message: "If you use Lab Ledger Dental in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Lab Ledger Dental"
abstract: >-
  Free desktop app for dental labs. It records every job from arrival to shipping,
  works out material costs from real pack prices and shows the profit that is left
  after running costs and taxes. Works offline and keeps all data on the computer.
  Windows, macOS and Linux.
type: software
